{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t位於佐敦的高景臺和康源閣暫停食水供應，水務署預計明天早上6時恢復供水。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n水務署網頁顯示，由於需要進行緊急維修水管工程，兩座大廈在傍晚7時09分起停水。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李俊傑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T12:01:10.385357+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":82,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:47:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:58.100607+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:58:46.641741+00:00","content_hash":"767c9a46e864f5101397c288434547dbfa29cfc7909075ea62bdec51fd372542","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}